# TODO Completed List

When completing a discrete piece of work (feature, fix, upgrade, or change set that has been committed or delivered), **update the "Completed" section in `TODO.md`** so the client can use it for invoicing and reporting.

Add an entry with:
- **Title:** Short descriptive name (e.g. "Multer upgrade (dicer CVE)")
- **Completed:** Date
- **What was done:** Brief summary of changes and outcome

Keep the same format as existing completed entries in `TODO.md`.
